{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Heart beats fast, [Em]colors and promises
[C]How to be brave? How can I [D]love when I'm afraid to fall?
[G]But watching you [Em]stand alone
[C]All of my doubt [D]suddenly goes away somehow

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
[G]One step closer

{comment: Chorus}
[G]I have died [Em]every day waiting for you
[C]Darling, don't [D]be afraid
[G]I have loved [Em]you for a thousand years
[C]I'll love you [D]for a thousand more

